Apollo Guidance Computer (DSKY) Application Launcher for Hyprland
- Symmetrical Top DSKY Panel: Annunciators (2x4) on Left, Proportional AGC Console (2x2) on Right
- Middle: Search Bar
- Bottom: Categorized Monospace App List
- High-contrast, clean typography, zero text-shadows, dynamic live theme sync
"""
